<p>v1 used <code>page</code>/<code>per_page</code> query parameters. v2 uses an opaque <code>cursor</code> and <code>next_cursor</code> — see <a href="/api/rate-limits-errors">Limits, quotas & errors</a> for the exact envelope.</p>

